WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.090
Someone once said:

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:53.220
There is a chips tree which grows leaves

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:58.530
the spitting image of crunchy, crisp potato chips right out of the fryer...

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:02.330
The Potato Birchip!

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.510
There is a mysterious island where when dawn breaks,

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:12.780
everything from the flowing rivers, to the waterfalls, to the springs,

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:16.110
turns to fresh, tart, silky smooth yogurt....

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.180
Yogurt Isle!

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:22.820
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:27.460
An age in which people quest for yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:31.030
Toriko breaks into the Coliseum

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:36.630
after he realizes that the ancient, legendary Battle Wolf is pregnant.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:41.240
On the one hand, a new life was brought into the world amidst all the panic,

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.910
but the Chief of the Gourmet Laboratory, Mansom, was attacked by a GT Robot.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.910
The mother Battle Wolf defeated the Demon Devil Python,

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.720
and as her child raced toward her,

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:56.320
the GT Robot fired a devastating shot right through her!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:04.330
The Ones that are Passed Down! Activate, Gourmet Cells!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.550
Chief, are you okay?

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.080
There's a hole open!

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.090
It's moving!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.460
I've numbed my sensation of pain, you see.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.860
It doesn't hurt one bit!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.300
I see... That's amazing.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.200
...I mean what the heck?!

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.370
Wait, Chief... Don't tell me you're planning on disinfecting it with that?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.480
What in the world is your body made of, actually?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.750
Worry about that mother wolf, rather than me.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.590
That last attack was a fatal blow.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.060
She's showering her cub with a lifetime's worth of love,

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.760
for the lifelong solitary battle that awaits...

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:52.270
What are you doing? Die already!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:59.580
Endorphin Smoke!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.150
What?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.120
Well, I got the shot off at least.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.490
The smoke is hiding them!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.290
It's not just normal smoke.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.060
It's Hyper Endorphin.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:19.000
It causes the brain to secrete endorphins that act as painkillers.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.270
It looks like it had more effect on the child than the mother, however...

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.570
See the look on the child's face?

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:38.850
It's calmed down, and cuddling up to its mom!

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:51.930
In this way, the two of them are carving into this brief time

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.900
the love passed down from eons ago...

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.540
You'll pay for this, GT Robot!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.980
GT Robot?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.280
That weird thing is a robot?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.650
Yes. A Gourmet Tele-Existence Robot.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:14.220
Tele... What's that?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.890
The operator can manipulate the robot from a distance

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.460
while experiencing the sights and sounds the robot does in real time.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.760
It's a type of virtual reality system.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:30.600
From Gourmet-type deep sea research vessels to space planetary probes,

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.970
a flesh and blood human can operate through a robot

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:37.610
to procure Gourmet Ingredients in dangerous lands...

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:42.880
Its abilities allow it to faithfully transmit the sensations of

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:47.320
sight, sound, touch, and even smell and taste to the operator.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:52.290
The true power of the operator is also transmitted through the robot.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.170
High technology like Tele-Existence

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.640
will always be put to nefarious uses by evildoers.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.790
That bastard...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:29.690
You won't have a single screw left in this world when I'm done with you!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:49.880
It's always humans who make me really mad...

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.980
Hey, anteater face!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:08:00.120
Oh, oh? Who might you mean?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.360
I mean you!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.510
His Gourmet Cells are activating through his anger!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.740
Gourmet Cells?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.380
Toriko, one of the Four Heavenly Kings... You look the least tasty of all!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.580
I'll pound you flat!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.620
I'm not capturing this time.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.890
I'm exterminating!

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:34.630
This is the first time I've seen Toriko-san really angry...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.530
Pointless killing that has nothing to do with living...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.930
That is what has spurred Toriko's anger, I am sure...

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.610
Titanium dioxide....

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.840
Plus, a slight smell of carbon...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.310
So, your body is made of a combination of carbon fiber and titanium alloy?

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:02.120
No damage from the blows I landed, then?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:07.260
Peeler Shot!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.430
What the...

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:15.630
A human skin peeler! I'll scrape off your entire body!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.540
It's no worse than peeling after getting a tan!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.540
Knife!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.950
Ingredient Processing Technique!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.380
Ingre-tech!

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:37.020
Human Grater!

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:43.160
My joints are made of special super high density polyethylene,

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:46.430
and my body is covered in strengthened aramid fiber!

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.500
There are no weak points!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.200
Let's just see about that!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.210
Five-Fold...

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:58.510
Spiked Punch!

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.390
That's my third Five-Fold today...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.630
All I've got left is my One Point Concentration...

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:19.930
Toriko-san...

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.300
Toriko's right arm should be reaching its limit...

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:34.050
You saucy bastard!

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.680
Toriko-san!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.930
I still have my left arm... I have to concentrate for a Five-Fold!

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:59.770
And to up my piercing power, Ice Pick as well!

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.650
Toriko-san!

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:10.520
Toriko's aiming for it, that bastard!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.990
Don't go telling me that's all the abilities you've got!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:20.830
Nice try acting tough, Toriko!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:25.230
Is it impossible for someone like you to operate a high-tech robot?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:26.430
Shut up!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.170
With kindergarten techniques like that,

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.640
no matter how many thousands of times you rub my skin,

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.970
I'll die of old age before it kills me!

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:36.170
Fine then, I'll kill you right now!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.240
I've been waiting for that!

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.450
Take a trip to the afterlife!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.980
After you!

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:51.360
One Point Concentration Five-Fold Ice Pick Spiked Punch!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:09.240
Serves him right, getting done in by his own cannon.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.650
My left arm is totally shot, too...

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.950
Can you still hear me?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.280
Let's call this a match for now!

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.950
Shut down the system and debrief your boss about what went wrong!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.120
Next time, come fight me in person, face to face, fair and square!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.530
Fool...

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.030
There won't be a next time.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.700
I'll take you with me, Toriko!

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.730
It's trying to self-destruct!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.240
Fire!

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.570
Fire!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.490
That's the GT Robot's core antenna?

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.790
Ick!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:04.000
Right! Blast it to bits!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.940
Open the hatch to my room!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:20.180
Ricky, can you hear me?

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:23.080
Finish off the thing coming out of Gate B!

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:42.600
Hayan Panther "Ricky" (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 35

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:47.440
Damn you, Toriko!

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:50.340
Next time I'll kill you for sure!

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:52.580
You can't defeat Toriko, yet.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:56.780
If you had gotten hit by his attacks with your actual body,

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.220
you'd already be dead.

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.820
What about the other robots?

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.350
While I was buying them time,

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:06.920
they managed to get a Regal Mammoth, right?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.430
All three landed a while ago.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:14.730
But none have seen any sign of the needed Mammoth.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:16.000
What?!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.540
Don't tell me that someone got it before us?!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.410
Don't fret...

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:23.140
We're already proceeding with our next move.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.060
It died while standing up.

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.230
Battle Wolf...

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:47.870
It's a majestic death worthy of one from a line of Kings.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.890
I'm glad you were able to be with her for a little while.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.640
You want to thank me?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:32.910
Just so you know... I didn't fight for your mother's sake.

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.680
That guy just really made me mad, so that's why I busted him up.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:42.220
From now on, you have to grow big and strong, enough to match your mother.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.260
Worried?

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:52.830
Don't worry.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:56.400
I was also a Chained Animal.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.070
I've fought here countless times...

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.040
Just like you.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.310
You're not alone.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.450
Toriko...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.820
Toriko-san...

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.960
A Battle Wolf, who is never tamed by anything,

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.160
has fallen for Toriko's big heart?

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.270
What?

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.110
Your fur feels nice...

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:41.110
It's like a thick towel...

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:45.420
That's it! I'll call you Terry... Terry Cloth!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.330
Now, everyone... Don't hold back!

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:05.500
We give thanks for this food!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.550
Yum!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:19.420
That's a super high-level Ingredient, a Bacchus Dragon, right?

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.150
I've never seen one before...

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.790
You can drink, right?

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:26.060
Tonight, I'll treat everyone to my Full Course!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.890
Your Full Course, Chief Mansom?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.930
Pickled Escargot (Mollusk) Capture Level 28

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:31.200
Pickled Escargot!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.530
Booze Clam Soup (Shellfish) Capture Level 25

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.670
Booze Clam Soup!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:36.170
Bacchus Shark (Fish) Capture Level 31

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.400
Bacchus Shark!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.100
Drunken Cow (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 30

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:38.770
Drunken Cow!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.740
Bacchus Dragon (Pterosaurian Beast) Capture Level 37

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.670
Bacchus Dragon!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.310
Bacchus Onion (Natural Vegetable) Capture Level 15

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.510
Bacchus Onion!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.810
Heavy Drinking Melon (Fruit) Capture Level 19

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:47.050
Heavy Drinking Melon!

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:49.880
Bacchus Whale Salt Water (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 33

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:50.280
Bacchus Whale Salt Water!

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:53.180
All the ingredients have alcohol in them...

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.150
He sure loves alcohol...

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.920
The Chief's Full Course tastes like crap!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.020
Nobody asked you!

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.830
This is definitely a heaping big scoop!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.260
Why is she here?

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:09.770
Amazing! Everything on the menu uses super high-level ingredients!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.240
Hold it.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.670
It's okay, Rin.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.080
To make up for what happened before,

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:20.240
I've invited her to get all the material she wants here.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.750
And that's the deal! Pardon moi.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:26.480
Sheesh. Don't get a big head!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:29.590
My head isn't a single gram bigger!

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.920
Honestly, you're a big pain!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.760
Did you just say "handsome"?

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.190
No, we didn't!

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:38.230
Sheesh, what a noisy bunch.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.170
I'm very proud of you, for being the most well-mannered here.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:49.740
The Battle Wolf is supposed to be a solitary creature...

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.980
But this one's let his guard down for Toriko...

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.750
Just like Ricky's gotten friendly with me.

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.950
Come here, Terry. Let's eat together.

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:10.960
My pal, who has inherited the genes of kings...

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.810
Lucky Terry...

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.340
He eats fast!

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:35.820
All the wounds over Toriko-san's face are suddenly vanishing...

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.190
Now that I think about it, the Chief, too...

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.430
Is there some secret hidden in Gourmet Cells?

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:44.700
Maybe it has something to do

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.670
with their overwhelming power that rivals any wild beast...

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:55.140
Thank you for this excellent meal.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:59.980
By the way, Chief... About the job I'm here for...?

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:02.180
Huh, job?

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.190
I forgot! The Regal Mammoth!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:13.460
Did the GT Robot infiltrate here in order to slow us down?

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:18.030
So they could capture the Regal Mammoth during the commotion?

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.700
Wasn't it your suggestion to go to the Coliseum, Chief?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:26.500
Oh, no! My little Regal-chan is going to fall into their hands!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.340
Regal-chan?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:29.910
Don't worry 'bout it.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:33.480
I just got a message from my brother.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.750
Seems like he's on this island.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:37.620
Sunny's here?

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:43.590
Yeah. He said he captured a Regal Mammoth and is heading here now.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:40.010
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:46.320
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:53.560
Each time I move out, the direction of the wind changes.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:58.500
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:03.600
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.970
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:11.480
on a journey with no end!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:16.380
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:19.550
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:25.560
amid the waves of time.

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:30.730
Gourmet News!

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:33.700
Today we've got the super high-level ingredient

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:36.570
that Chef Komatsu was so moved by... *hic*

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:46.210
Bacchus Dragon (Pterosaurian Beast) Capture Level 37

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:38.800
Bacchus Dragon!

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:42.340
The meat juice tastes and smells like rich brandy,

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:46.210
and I think I might be a little drunk myself... *hic*

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:51.050
Hey, sunglasses dude over there!

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:54.550
You mean me?

00:22:54.550 --> 00:22:57.820
Johannes sure is a "good little soldier".

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:01.090
He ain't 1 gram different than my news chief!

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.460
Now, on to the next story...

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:08.680
The third Heavenly King has arrived!

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:10.800
He used Knocking without even touching his target!

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:13.440
He's kind of a weirdo, but really strong!

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:17.250
The Man Who Has an Invincible 
Domain! His Name is Sunny!

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:19.520
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
